<!-- Main Content Canvas -->
<main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center py-stack-lg px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop w-full max-w-[100%] pb-24 md:pb-8">
<div class="w-full max-w-container-max flex flex-col gap-stack-lg items-center">
<div class="text-center max-w-2xl">
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-stack-sm">Review Your Application</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Carefully review the final document before generating the PDF. This format complies with the Right to Information Act, 2005.</p>
</div>
<!-- Document Preview Container (Paper Aesthetic) -->
<div class="w-full max-w-[800px] bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant shadow-sm rounded-DEFAULT overflow-hidden">
<!-- Document Header Strip -->
<div class="bg-surface-container px-6 py-3 border-b border-outline-variant flex justify-between items-center">
<span class="font-mono-label text-mono-label text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">description</span>
                        FORM-A (See Rule 3(1))
                    </span>
<span class="font-mono-label text-mono-label text-on-surface-variant">Status: DRAFT</span>
</div>
<!-- Document Body (The Letter) -->
<div class="p-8 md:p-12 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface flex flex-col gap-6 leading-relaxed">
<div class="text-center mb-4">
<h3 class="font-bold uppercase underline tracking-wider mb-2">Application Under The Right To Information Act, 2005</h3>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<p>To,</p>
<p class="font-bold">The Public Information Officer,</p>
<p>[Department/Authority Name Placeholder]</p>
<p>[Department Address Placeholder]</p>
<p>[City, State, PIN Placeholder]</p>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<p class="font-bold whitespace-nowrap">Subject:</p>
<p class="underline underline-offset-4">Request for information regarding road repairs and infrastructure development in [Locality Name] under section 6(1) of the RTI Act.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mt-4">
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">1. Full Name of the Applicant:</span> [User Full Name Placeholder]</p>
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">2. Father's/Spouse Name:</span> [Father/Spouse Name Placeholder]</p>
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">3. Permanent Address:</span> [Applicant Full Address Placeholder]</p>
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">4. Contact Number:</span> [Applicant Phone Number]</p>
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">5. Email ID:</span> [Applicant Email]</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-4">
<p class="font-bold mb-3">6. Particulars of Information Required:</p>
<p class="mb-2">I kindly request you to provide the following information pertaining to the subject mentioned above:</p>
<div class="pl-6 flex flex-col gap-4 mt-4">
<div class="flex gap-3">
<span class="font-bold">a)</span>
<p>Please provide a certified copy of the total budget allocated for road repairs in Ward [Number] for the financial year 2023-2024.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-3">
<span class="font-bold">b)</span>
<p>Provide details of the contractor(s) awarded the tender for repairing the main road in [Locality Name], including the tender amount and expected date of completion.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-3">
<span class="font-bold">c)</span>
<p>Supply a copy of the quality inspection report conducted on the recently completed patch works along [Street Name].</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">7. Application Fee Details:</span> Attached Postal Order / DD No. [Number] dated [Date] for Rs. 10/- favoring [Accounts Officer Name].</p>
<p><span class="font-bold mr-2">8. Below Poverty Line (BPL):</span> No</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant border-dashed">
<p class="font-bold mb-2">Declaration:</p>
<p class="text-sm">I state that the information sought does not fall within the restrictions contained in Section 8 and 9 of the RTI Act and to the best of my knowledge it pertains to your office. I also state that I am a citizen of India and I am eligible to seek information under the Right to Information Act 2005.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-12 flex justify-between items-end">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<p>Place: [City Placeholder]</p>
<p>Date: [Current Date Placeholder]</p>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
<div class="w-32 h-12 border-b border-outline mb-1"></div>
<p>(Signature of Applicant)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Action Footer -->
